  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FN-konventioner rapport</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Treaties reporting</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tajikistan har ratificerat samtliga viktiga FN-konventioner som r&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter men rapportering har hittills avlagts bara under barnkonventionen. Sidas insats utg&#xF6;r en andra fas av ett projekt som syftar till att utveckla kapacitet f&#xF6;r rapportering och etablera en plattform f&#xF6;r dialog om m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter i  Tadzjikistan i vilken b&#xE5;de statsmakten och civila samh&#xE4;llet deltar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tajikistan has ratified all of the main UN treaties on human rights but so far only reported under the convention on the rights of the child. The project is a second phase to develop capacity for meeting reporting requirements under HR treaties and the establishment of a platform for dialogue on human rights in Tajikistan in which both the Government and the civil society participates.</narrative>
  </description>
